WEBVTT

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Hey, watch it! Be careful where you go!

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.830
I-I'm terribly sorry, Miss Luna!

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.500
Do you think it's funny if I bruise my butt
before subduing this Demon Lord?

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:32.040
I-Is this even a good idea
without the other Holy Maidens?

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:36.200
Excuse me? Are you saying
it's too much for me to handle?

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.410
Y-You're more than enough
on your own, Miss Luna.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:42.040
Hmph! Of course I am.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:45.450
I can't let my sisters show
me up forever, you know.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:47.000
"Luna Elegant"
"16 years old"

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:54.830
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.370
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:04.950
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:08.250
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.700
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:20.500
<i>I learned that true kindness is</i>
<i>actually solitude after looking at you</i>

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:27.000
<i>I wanted to get closer to your heart</i>
<i>and yet it's still so far away</i>

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:33.830
<i>No matter what fate gets in my way,</i>
<i>I'll face it head on</i>

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:41.080
<i>With the bravery I chose with you,</i>
<i>let's flap our wings and fly</i>

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:46.370
<i>My heart is trembling with the hope that I found</i>

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:49.830
<i>Resounding inside me</i>
<i>move my heart</i>

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:53.290
<i>Lurking behind my hidden true motives</i>

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:56.750
<i>With a stronger gaze than anyone else</i>

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:00.040
<i>Dwelling in the eyes of</i>
<i>that majestic figure are wishes</i>

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:03.660
<i>Let's sing to the sleepless night</i>

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:06.830
<i>Dramatically pull everything in,</i>
<i>even light and darkness</i>

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:10.410
<i>In order to smile again tomorrow, unafraid</i>

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:12.040
<i>Let's begin</i>

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:14.040
<i>Open your eyes</i>

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:21.950
"Golden Luna"

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:32.040
Reporting in! The Holy Maiden, Luna Elegant,

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.950
is approaching on the road
with an escort of some 20 troops!

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:40.120
What? Has she come to subjugate us at last?

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:48.500
It's such an honor for a Holy Maiden
to come deal with us herself.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.700
"Chief of the Moles" "O Wengoal"
We'll have to face her head on.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:55.330
"Chief of the Moles" "O Wengoal"
N-No, it doesn't seem like her target is us Moles...

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.160
Oh?

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:05.950
"Demon Lord" "Hakuto Kunai"
"Girl cast out as a sacrifice" "Aku"
It's getting dark pretty quickly now.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.700
You're right. Shall we camp out here tonight?

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.950
Huh? You mean right here?

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.910
Fragment of my intelligence, come forth!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.620
Survival Goods!

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:23.330
"Survival Goods"

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:24.870
Whoa!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:30.200
There is no end to my darkness! Defense Goods!

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:32.370
"Defense Goods"

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.080
Whoa!

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:39.330
Alone, they don't achieve very much, but...

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:42.620
Item Combine! Construct Base!

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:45.290
"Base"

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:49.790
I-Incredible! Was that magic just now?

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.120
You're so incredible, Demon Lord!

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:59.250
This baby can withstand attacks
from even a rocket launcher.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:04.750
You're as good as dead in <i>Infinity Game</i>
unless you camp out like this.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:11.540
I-Is that right? Not that I
understand what you're saying...

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.200
I'm just saying it's pretty sturdy.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:17.370
Aku, we're sleeping in this base tonight.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:22.080
I'm a delicate guy, so there's no way
I'm camping under the stars.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.620
Okay! Leave the house chores to me!

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:29.120
This is...?

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.330
Go on. Give your weary body a wash.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:37.450
H-Hold on. I can't use something like this...

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:42.330
Sorry it's cramped, but this
is the best I can do for now.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:43.950
Th-That's not what I...

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:48.500
Just you wait and see.
I'll construct a hot spring resort someday.

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.250
You're going to love every minute of it.

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:57.200
I wonder what a hot spring resort is anyways?

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:02.910
Seems like this world has a moon too...

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:07.200
If I gather enough skill points
to unlock administrator privileges,

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:10.500
can I return back to my world?

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:14.410
Though, that whole system
is based off of <i>Infinity Game</i>.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:18.750
No such "return to my world"
command even exists.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:22.620
If being summoned by that idol
is what brought me here,

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:28.040
the only way to return must be to
seek out something with similar power.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:31.910
Let's hope I find a clue in the Holy Capital.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:35.750
But even if I went back,
would I still have the same life?

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:38.410
Is there still a place for me at work?

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.700
I bet my manager's furious...

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:48.750
Demon Lord, I washed my body
with that <i>shabon </i>again.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:56.250
Mmm, you do smell pretty good now.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.330
R-Really?!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:01.500
That's the first time someone's
told me that in my life!

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:10.160
You... want to sleep together?

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:11.410
Is that a no?

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:17.450
I know you think I'm some old guy or something,

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:21.790
but the truth is, I'm more like
an older brother. I'm no old man.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:25.870
Demon Lord? I don't understand
what you're talking about...

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.620
Bring it on, Holy Maiden and friends.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.080
Us bandits, the Moles,
silence even crying babies.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:41.700
None slip under our noses.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:49.330
Who in the world are those two?

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:51.160
What do we do, Chief?

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.830
Hmm, must be bait.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.620
The moment we attack them,

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:59.500
the Holy Maiden and her crew
will jump out and ambush us.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:02.040
Should we do nothing and let them go?

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:06.290
No, we'll get 'em.
A quick attack and a quick retreat.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:09.000
Draw the Holy Maiden into unfamiliar terrain.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.950
These guys are a joke.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:19.950
I'll turn off my intercept and
auto attack abilities just in case...

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.160
Aku, stand back.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.540
Huh?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:27.250
I guess I should just take this attack.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.290
"Assault Barrier"

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:32.540
Hmph, under level 30? How weak.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:37.370
In <i>Infinity Game</i>, only players
at the max level of 30 were able to...

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:40.870
...inflict any sort of damage to Kunai, but...

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:46.830
How about we skip the hide-and-seek
and you show yourself?

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:55.750
You're pretty tough.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:59.250
I'm the Chief of the Moles, O Wengoal.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.500
And you are?

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:05.200
Huh? My manager?
What in the world is he doing here?

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:09.160
Sorry about not showing up to work, Mr. Senmu.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.250
Shenmue, you said?

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:16.080
Shenmue... Shenmue, huh? That takes me back...

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.200
What are you talking about?

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:22.580
Uh, wait... Aren't you Aoki Senmu?

00:08:22.580 --> 00:08:26.750
Hmph. Are you trying to confuse me or something?

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.540
That won't work on me.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:32.160
No, that wasn't my intention, but...

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:37.250
What a crazy resemblance.
Man, do they look alike...

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:41.870
By that trick you conjured up just now,
I take it you're a magic user?

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.950
I've no obligation to answer.

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:46.620
Take us lightly and you'll get hurt.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.160
Got it, old man?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.950
Wh-Who you calling an old man?!
You're more an old man than me!

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:56.830
A-Are you kidding me?!
If anyone here has an old man face, it's you!

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:58.830
--It's not my fault you were born that way, idiot!
--I'll give you an old man face!

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.250
--Old man?! Don't make me laugh!
--Who do you think you are?!
You're the one who's an idiot!

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:03.200
Demon Lord, let's run!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:06.540
Demon Lord, you say? Someone like you?

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:10.830
Go pretend you're a
Demon Lord on the other side!

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.290
I-I knew he had to be a magic user!

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.250
What was that about magic?

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.330
Wh-What the...?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:34.620
To think I'd come Demon Lord hunting
and find a bunch of filthy bandits.

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:39.080
Tsk, the plan is falling apart...
Guys, pull back!

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.910
How stupid can you be?

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:44.080
You think you can get away from me?

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:46.790
Be torn asunder by gold! Gold Slash!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:49.200
"Gold Blade" "Gold Slash"

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:59.700
Ow... My Assault Barrier never activated...

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.370
This kid is max level?

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:06.790
To be honest, I wasn't expecting
that much out of you.

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.580
Excuse me?! What did you just say?!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:15.080
Anyways, do I not get an apology
for you attacking me out of nowhere?

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:20.250
Hmph! A Holy Maiden dispatching evil
is just plain common sense.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:24.120
All right, then. Those will be your last words.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.910
Hmph. It seems you don't know who I am.

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:31.950
I'm one of the three Holy Maidens.
The Golden Luna Elegant.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:36.330
This kid shooting off magic
like a maniac is named Elegant?

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.620
Way to not live up to the name.

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:41.830
You guys, go capture this blockhead at once!

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:42.830
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:52.580
Unfortunately, you all have no
business standing in front of me.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:02.330
Who in the world is this guy?

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:05.750
H-Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:15.370
I don't hold back on those who attack me,
even if they happen to be women.

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:19.000
Huh? Wait! No, don't! What are you doing?!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.950
That hurt!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.500
That hurts!

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.330
The butt! Not the butt!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:33.330
That was my right hand! This is my left hand!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.830
And now let's go back to the right hand!

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:39.870
--Stop it!
--And this one's because I'm kinda enjoying this!

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:44.290
S-Stop!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:50.000
"Luna Elegant" "Race: Human" "Sex: Female"
"Age: 16" "Height: 153cm"

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:55.000
"Mild Heaven" "Race: Tobacco" "Sex: None"
"Age: None" "Height: 8cm"

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.450
That was a good workout.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:02.790
I-I wonder if the Holy Maiden's butt
will be all right?

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:05.790
It's already had a split in it. She'll be fine.

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.080
Th-That's not the problem here...

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:15.040
Now then. Now that we've got all this money,
how about we stay in a city?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:23.660
I'll kill that guy! You just wait and see!

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:28.330
You stupid coachman! Go a little slower!
It stings my butt!

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:31.790
"Kingdom of Holy Light"
"Market City Yahoo"

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:37.750
The naming sense of this kingdom
is truly something awful.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.580
You think so?

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:43.580
Let's buy some random stuff
with all this money we've got.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.540
But that's the Holy Maiden's money, isn't it?

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:48.910
I was acting in self-defense.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.870
In fact, you could say I was
being extra kind and lenient.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:56.160
If this were an <i>eroge</i>,
we'd be heading for a sex slave route.

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.620
What's an <i>eroge</i>?

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:06.790
How much?

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:09.250
It's three copper for two skewers.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.080
Thank you.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:14.160
Come again!

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:17.750
U-Um...

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:21.790
It's my treat today. Just eat it and enjoy.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.620
I've never eaten something this tasty before!

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:34.410
"Gugule Inn"
This place has one terrible name after another...

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:38.200
Really? I think it's a cute name though.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:40.620
Welcome.

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.910
I'd like the best room you've got.

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:48.290
If you'd like to stay in our best room,
it would cost one gold coin.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:51.160
What?! We shouldn't, Demon Lord!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.870
D-Demon...?

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:56.290
No, you see... My name is De Mon.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.370
Sorry to confuse you like that.

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:01.870
Then, if you please.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:06.160
V-Very well, Sir. I'll go prepare it at once.

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.790
"Message"
Don't call me Demon Lord in front of people!

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:13.250
Call me your older brother or something.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.870
Wh-What about if I called you Papa?

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:20.330
But I'm still a spunky bachelor!

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:27.580
Please, make yourselves at home
and enjoy the room.

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.000
Not a bad view, is it?

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:40.000
To be honest, I'm surprised at how
luxurious this place actually is.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:43.870
Then again, I've got to keep
acting cool around Aku.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:49.700
A-Amazing! It's like we're
staying in a noble's estate!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.330
Don't get too excited over this.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:56.790
Someday I'll build a castle
befitting of my greatness.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.500
C-Castle?

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.040
I don't know what you mean,
but it sure sounds great!

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:06.410
Now then, how about we go out
and have a nice dinner tonight?

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:09.370
But... before that...

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.910
"Boutique"
"Fashion Check"

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:17.330
Dear me.
That's one shabby outfit she's wearing...

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:20.450
Perhaps she's this man's servant or something?

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:24.950
Welcome! May I ask what
you're looking for today?

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:28.950
Sorry, but could you find an outfit
that looks good on her?

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:32.120
I'm not that great at picking
out clothes for people.

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.910
I'd like to leave that to a pro.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:37.910
This one looks like the biggest...

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.040
Using this guy.

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:41.370
What?!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.950
Demon Lo--

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:47.500
G-Giant gold coin?!
Y-You want to pick something with that?

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.660
Is it not enough?

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:54.080
D-Don't be silly! I-I'll prepare
something for you at once!

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.160
This way please, Ma'am.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:15:59.620
U-Um...

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:04.620
I'd like to smoke, but where are your ashtrays?

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:10.410
Use my hands! Please, feel free
to dispose of your ash on my hands!

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:12.660
Th-That's quite all right.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.370
Have any normal ashtrays and a place to sit?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.450
Use my back!
Please, come and sit down on my back!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:22.700
What the hell? This store is scary...

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.790
S-Sorry to make you wait.

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:34.330
U-Um, do you think this looks good on me?

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:38.370
Ooh! I knew she'd shine
with a bit of polish, but...

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:40.830
To think she would change this much...

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.040
Y-Yeah...

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:48.950
Whoa... Aku had different-colored eyes?

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:53.580
I wonder if that's a subject
better to avoid though?

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.370
Hmm?

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:57.790
I could bring other outfits
to try if you would like.

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:59.910
Would you be interested in that?

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:03.620
Let's see... I'll take everything
that suits her.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.790
D-Did you say everything?!

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.200
I'll buy it all.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:12.910
Hurry up! Bring only the
best clothes for this lady!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.660
I wonder if they're father and daughter.

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:23.540
They don't seem like that to me.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:27.200
He must own a great plot of land somewhere...

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:31.830
I heard he paid for her outfit with a
giant gold coin without batting an eye.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:42.160
Oho! That's the wine all the
connoisseurs always order.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:44.700
Seems like he's a man of good taste.

00:17:52.870 --> 00:17:55.120
This feels so much like a dream.

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:57.540
Hmm?

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:02.450
I have to thank you...
For doing all this for someone like me...

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:06.830
Don't worry about it.
Let's eat before it gets cold.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:09.120
I do worry about it.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:12.580
Why are you always being so nice to me?

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:17.450
Now that you mention it,
I wonder what makes me go so far for her.

00:18:19.290 --> 00:18:25.620
Please, tell me. Is there anything
I can possibly do to pay you back?

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:31.450
Anything you want! As long as it's
something I can do, I'll do it!

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.910
You said you'll do anything I want?

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:39.290
I found you, Demon Lord!

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:40.660
D-Demon Lord?!

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.200
I wonder if she's talking about that man.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:47.700
Who said you could eat with my money?!
Are you stupid? Wanna die?!

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:49.330
What an odd thing to say.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:52.580
Wasn't that the money you
offered to me as an apology?

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:57.250
Because if I hadn't done that,
you wouldn't have stopped hitting my butt!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:01.500
Let's not get all wound up.
Come and sit down with us.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.250
We wouldn't want to bother the other guests.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:07.700
Give me one good reason I should listen to you!

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:11.120
Do you... want to be disciplined again?

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:19.580
I'm glad to see you can be reasonable.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:24.080
Everyone, I apologize for
causing that commotion.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:29.870
Allow me to make up for it by
treating each table to a bottle of wine.

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.830
Oh, my, how generous!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.750
What an admirable fellow.

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.950
Bring some food for the lady too.

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:41.450
It's my treat. Have as much as you'd like.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.040
You idiot! More like it's <i>my </i>treat!

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:48.410
Um, I'm so sorry, Holy Maiden.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:51.080
Demon Lord isn't a bad person, you know.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.040
Are you stupid?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:55.540
There's no such thing as a good Demon Lord!

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:03.910
I guess you can be very kind
sometimes but also pretty mean too.

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:06.700
I always act like a gentleman.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:09.450
It's just that I choose who to treat nicely.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.200
Jeez...

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:14.580
The Holy Maiden is a very
important person, Demon Lord.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:22.540
I can't exactly carry her on my
back or shoulders with a dress.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.830
I changed my mind... You're very kind...

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:29.830
Hmm?

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:41.500
Idiot! I've got no money to
stay anywhere thanks to you!

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:43.660
Can't you just camp somewhere?

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:47.330
What happened to your troupe, Teary-eyed Luna?

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:49.290
I sent them all home!

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:51.160
And why would you do that?

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:56.000
B-Because! I didn't want to
put them in any more danger!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:58.290
So you decided to come and play?

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.500
Th-That's not what I'm saying!

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:06.160
Demon Lord! Could you please be
a little nicer to the Holy Maiden?

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.580
All right then... Here.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.540
What is it? Something else that you want?

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:18.830
S-So be it! I'll let you two
stay in this room with me!

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:20.790
Is your head on straight?

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:23.500
Y-You got the room with my money, right?

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:26.410
It's only proper that I'm allowed to sleep in it!

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:29.540
I think she's got you there, Demon Lord.

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:41.910
Sister! We've almost reached the city!

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:46.160
How dare that shitty brat
cause me all this trouble.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>"I wish I could go back"</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:21.290
Shenmue... Shenmue, huh?

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:26.370
That takes me back. An open world
in a time like that was amazing.

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:31.250
With motion capture and
full-voiced NPCs in the city too...

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:34.500
Not to mention the game had a full day cycle.

00:23:34.500 --> 00:23:38.290
That was so sick!
It's making me wanna play it again...

00:23:38.290 --> 00:23:41.620
Demon Lord, I have no idea
what you're talking about.

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:42.370
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry </i>Episode 3. Killer Queen.

00:23:42.370 --> 00:23:46.950
"Killer Queen"
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry </i>Episode 3. Killer Queen.
